    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "2-Bedroom House, Portobello, Dublin 8\n\n2 bedroom house in the heart of Portobello, Dublin 8, combining modern interiors with a private outdoor courtyard. The property comprises a bright and spacious living/dining area, fully fitted kitchen, two well-proportioned bedrooms and a contemporary bathroom.\n\nThe house is ideally located in one of Dublin 8’s most popular neighbourhoods, with Portobello, Camden Street and Dublin city centre all within easy walking distance, alongside excellent cafés, restaurants and transport links.\n\n8-month lease only. Bills not included. \n\nContact: portobellohouse6@gmail.com with your details \n\nPlease note that the artwork and certain lamps and furniture are no longer present in the property."
      }
